devil-damnations-ui-menu-title = Book of Damnations
devil-damnations-ui-menu-text = Below lies the list of deals you are permitted to strike with the crew. Each deal has a cost associated with it. Damnations that negatively affect the crew will have a negative cost, and benefits for them will have a positive cost. In order to balance our books, each contract must have their deals add to a number below zero - meaning that we profit from the deal. To include a damnation in the contract, simply include it's name in the list inside of the contract. The victim must sign a valid infernal contract for the deal to take effect.
devil-damnations-ui-damnation-name = {CAPITALIZE($name)}
devil-damnations-ui-cost = Cost: {$cost}
devil-damnations-ui-benefits = Benefits
devil-damnations-ui-disadvantages = Curses